<com.aptare.sc.dal.versioning.ObjectMap>
  <version>2</version>
  <className>com.aptare.sc.domain.reportTemplateDesigner.RtdTemplate</className>
  <data>
    <entry>
      <string>longDescription</string>
      <string>It???s useful for showing which LUNs have DeDup and compression.  It will show all details about the indiviapt_v_dual LUNs (maybe too much information) but are filters that allow you to narrow down the focus. 1. You can look at all of the LUNs on single array.  2. You can look at all the LUNs that have DeDup enabled on a single array or across multiple arrays.  3. You can look at LUNs that don&apos;t have DeDup and compression enabled.   4. You can look at LUNs that are getting a specific DeDup ratio or compression ratio on a single array or across multiple arrays.</string>
    </entry>
    <entry>
      <string>reportVersion</string>
      <string>1.0</string>
    </entry>
    <entry>
      <string>isCloudTemplate</string>
      <boolean>false</boolean>
    </entry>
    <entry>
      <string>inventoryType</string>
      <list>
        <long>1</long>
      </list>
    </entry>
